## A little syntax goes a long way. {#syntax bold}

The source stays readable. The result is a real, interactive document. {muted}

:::grid {cols-2 gap-lg}
:::container {full}
**01 / WRITE THIS** {small primary}

```taildown
:::card {light-glass}
## A place for your next idea

Write something worth sharing.

[Explore](#next){button primary}
:::
```

Standard Markdown handles the content. Plain-English attributes handle the presentation. {small muted}
:::

:::container {full}
**02 / MAKE THIS** {small primary}

:::card {light-glass}
## A place for your next idea

Write something worth sharing.

[Explore](#next){button primary}
:::

