### A guide people can use

Clear explanations, highlighted code, and details that open when a reader needs them.

[Start with the essentials :icon[arrow-up-right]{small}](getting-started.html)
:::
:::card
### An idea with room to grow

Use headings, diagrams, and supporting notes to turn a rough thought into a document worth keeping.

[Learn the syntax :icon[arrow-up-right]{small}](syntax-guide.html)
